	url = {https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sUk9y23FPHk},
	abstract = {The principle of least action is a different way of looking at physics that has applications to everything from Newtonian mechanics, to relativity, quantum mechanics, and beyond. Get the notes for free here: https://courses.physicswithelliot.com...

Take my full course on Lagrangian mechanics: https://courses.physicswithelliot.com...

